# DRC-WS-3: Same rule; block exactly 10x10 and a line 2 away; CAP without, then with option wide-width-noninclusive (second style).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load top
box 0 0 10 10
paint m1
box 12 0 28 2
paint m1
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
drc style noninclusive
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
save top
